# node Ed25519 implementation. Forwards to the linked eddsa runtime shim (Web Crypto Ed25519). make-key-pair-bytes returns the 32-byte private key and 32-byte public key concatenated (64 raw bytes); messages and signatures are raw bytes. Internal: reached only through the public signature API.

dock load
  load <global:eddsa>, name eddsa

task make-key-pair-bytes
  note async
  like bytes
  send back
    call eddsa/make-key-pair

task sign-message
  note async
  take private-key, like bytes
  take message, like bytes
  like bytes
  send back
    call eddsa/sign
      read private-key
      read message

task verify-message
  note async
  take public-key, like bytes
  take message, like bytes
  take signature, like bytes
  like boolean
  send back
    call eddsa/verify
      read public-key
      read message
      read signature
